  "verdict": "DEFICIT SURVIVES RAS",
  "reason": "the exact-rate gap under RAS is +94.3 points, +2.2 points above the top of the [+66.7, +92.1] range the penalty and greedy arms already span on this checkpoint, and at or above its +66.7 floor; the robustness claim extends to the repetition-history-aware axis",
